                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="painNote" value="What changes vs. the v1 journey: real-time availability removes the WAITING stage entirely. There is no request-vs-appointment gap, no Confirmation Ladder, no keep-warm 24h reminders, and no human coordination on the happy path — the booking IS the confirmation. Prerequisite (and the reason this is the IDEAL, not v1): the independent centers must expose a real scheduling API / live availability, which the Problem Definition notes they do not have today." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e6;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
